{"author":{"id":"89da5fec8eff6d69dbcdd68f81be7e9163b16f34b17e978ecf3554487379f453"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1774053030,"nonce":"8w6oTZzotolE9Ecw+ekP7gJE6ng=","title":"Umbrella: Presets tab — modular composable agent instruction management","message":"A new top-level \"Presets\" tab in Mandible for managing modular, composable agent instruction presets. Presets are 1:1 with Markdown files (headings = tree structure, content = instructions). Multiple presets can be unioned for a chat session.\n\n**Scope (20 implement-now issues across 3 parallel tracks):**\n\nTrack A — Backend: data model + migration, CRUD API, Markdown parser/serializer, union engine, SDK integration (systemPrompt + settingSources override), session-preset plumbing, convention library endpoint, export/import endpoints, workflow violation detection hook, promotion policy settings.\n\nTrack B — Presets Tab UI: API client, tab shell + sidebar, tree editor with pragmatic-drag-and-drop, preset diff view, convention library view + sidebar entry, insert-from-library command palette modal, promotion dialog UI.\n\nTrack C — Chat Integration: NewSessionDialog preset selector (pill-style), live sidebar preset pills, \"Start Chat\" + bidirectional nav, preset provenance in chat history, violation stream callout + inbox integration, export/import UI, token/context indicator, PTY deprecation banner.\n\n**Key design decisions:**\n- Node model: title (heading text, no ## prefix) + body (markdown below heading, above children) + level\n- Copy semantics for library imports (not reference)\n- Version counter from day one (presets.version + session_presets.preset_version)\n- pragmatic-drag-and-drop for tree DnD (Preact compatible, 4.7kB)\n- Convention library is a derived view (query over leaf nodes), not a separate table\n- Routing algorithm for workflow violations: Jaccard similarity + repo-specific signals + 3-option promotion dialog\n\nSee related: c58acc8 (configurable policies umbrella), 18ff089 (agent roles), 8ba1e90 (blank-slate experiment)","files":null}]}